  "body": "Modern Architectural 5 Bedroom Family Home! Ready to be relocated to your site! #Nile\r\n\r\nThis impressive 280sqm architecturally designed home has been created to maximize light, space, and modern family living at its finest. Offering five bedrooms and four beautifully appointed bathrooms, there is plenty of comfort and privacy for the whole family.\r\n\r\nA highlight of the home is the huge modern kitchen, complete with plentiful cupboard space and a layout designed for effortless cooking and entertaining.\r\n\r\nDesigned with today’s lifestyle in mind, the home also features two dedicated office spaces, perfect for working from home or study. Clever storage solutions are thoughtfully integrated throughout, ensuring every area is used to its full potential.\r\n\r\nEvery detail has been carefully considered to blend style with everyday practicality. The spacious, light-filled living areas extend across two levels, creating the perfect combination of open-plan family spaces and quiet private retreats.\r\n\r\nThis is a home where families can truly grow, relax, and create lasting memories.\r\n\r\nFeatures include:\r\n*  5 bedrooms\r\n*  4 bathrooms\r\n*  2 offices (or another bedroom)\r\n*  Huge bi-fold doors opening from both living areas\r\n*  Internal access garage\r\n*  2 master bedrooms with ensuites and stunning walk-in wardrobes\r\n*  Large designer kitchen with generous bench space and scullery\r\n*  High-end appliances and quality fixtures throughout\r\n*  Gorgeous aluminium joinery\r\n*  Iron roof in good condition\r\n*  Quality weatherboard cladding in good condition\r\n\r\nThis stunning home is ready for its next owner. Come and experience the space and design for yourself — get in touch today to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nPrice includes GST and relocation within 100kms. Foundations included at a standard 3604 pile height and depth.\r\n\r\nFor viewing or more information please contact me. \r\nCall/Text or email: Marissa on 0274 999 828 Email: marissa@nzhouseremovals.co.nz\r\n\r\nPrice is for house and relocation only (not the section).\r\n Price does not include any Council fees, Architect drawings, Insurance or connections to services.\r\n\r\nWe can help you arrange your building consent and Insurance. Finance, subject to terms and conditions, can be arranged as well.\r\n\r\nUse our inhouse Architect for your house Plans and applications with Council as well as Geotech, engineers and surveyor’s. Call or Text Marissa on 0274999828\r\n\r\nKEYWORDS: transportable home, transportable dwelling, transportable building, transportable house, relocatable house, relocatable dwelling, relocatable building, removable house, removable dwelling, removable home, removable building, villa, house for removal, building for removal, dwelling for removal, home for removal, house haulage, clear my site, houses for removal, homes for removal, buildings for removal, dwellings for removal, renovate, investment, house demolition, demolition, bungalow, character home, character dwelling, character building, development, investment opportunity, developments, preloved home, preloved house, secondhand house, second hand house, portable home, portable house.",
